    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII guard for temporary directory cleanup with exception safety. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Error Code: 7501</para>
</simplesect>
The destructor wraps fs::remove_all() in try-catch to handle:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Files still open (permission issues on Windows/some Unix)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Concurrent access from other processes</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Symlink attacks or other filesystem issues</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Example: { <ref refid="classthemis_1_1updates_1_1_temporary_dir_guard" kindref="compound">TemporaryDirGuard</ref> temp_dir(&quot;/tmp/build_verify_123&quot;); // ... do work ... } // Destructor safely cleans up, suppressing exceptions </para>
    </detaileddescription>
